    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "nonfarm payroll nfp",
   "nombre_canonico": "Nonfarm Payrolls (NFP)",
   "tipo": "dato",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Nonfarm Payrolls (NFP)"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    233
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Release macroeconómico de empleo estadounidense de alto impacto, usado como evento principal de descubrimiento de MPD/EMC durante el proof-of-concept de mayo-octubre 2024 en EUR/USD.",
     "doc_id": 233
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "The initial discovery period was intentionally narrow. From May through Oct 2024, the focus was on just two types of U.S. releases in EUR/USD: Nonfarm Payrolls (NFP) and Consumer Price Index (CPI).",
     "doc_id": 233
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "CAUSA",
     "tipo_original": "CAUSA",
     "objeto_texto": "Microstructural Pulse Dislocation",
     "doc_id": 233,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre release stop run",
   "nombre_canonico": "Pre-Release Stop-Run",
   "tipo": "fenomeno",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Pre-Release Stop-Run"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    233
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Movimiento direccional agudo minutos antes del timestamp del evento que carece de la estructura MPD (sin timestamp preciso, sin segmentación en pulsos, comportamiento de thin-book). Debe distinguirse del verdadero Pulse #1 para evitar trampas.",
     "doc_id": 233
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Structurally, this pre-release move lacks the hallmarks of MPD: it does not align exactly with the release timestamp, it lacks clean segmentation into pulses, and the order-book behavior is more consistent with a deliberate thin-book stop-run.",
     "doc_id": 233
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "SE_OPONE_A",
     "tipo_original": "SE_OPONE_A",
     "objeto_texto": "Microstructural Pulse Dislocation",
     "doc_id": 233,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "random forest classification",
   "nombre_canonico": "Random Forest Classification",
   "tipo": "metodo",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Random Forest Classification"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    234
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Algoritmo de machine learning supervisado usado para predecir el signo de cambios en 5 medidas de dinámica de precios (volatilidad, autocorrelación, skewness, kurtosis, Jarque-Bera) a partir de features de microestructura.",
     "doc_id": 234
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "We use random forest machine learning to ascertain overall predictability and to determine which features are most important for understanding market dynamics.",
     "doc_id": 234
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "VPIN",
     "doc_id": 234,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "Roll Measure",
     "doc_id": 234,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cross market microstructure effect",
   "nombre_canonico": "Cross-Market Microstructure Effects",
   "tipo": "fenomeno",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Cross-Market Microstructure Effects"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    234
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Fenómeno donde las métricas de microestructura de BTC y ETH (Roll y VPIN) tienen poder predictivo significativo sobre las dinámicas de precios de otras criptomonedas (XRP, SOL, ADA), indicando factores comunes de liquidez e información.",
     "doc_id": 234
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Cross effects are also important: BTC Roll and VPIN and ETH Roll and VPIN have strong predictive power for price dynamics across the other crypto currencies.",
     "doc_id": 234
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "CAUSA",
     "tipo_original": "CAUSA",
     "objeto_texto": "price dynamics in altcoins",
     "doc_id": 234,
     "revisar": false
    },
    {
     "tipo": "USA",
     "tipo_original": "USA",
     "objeto_texto": "VPIN",
     "doc_id": 234,
     "revisar": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "crypto winter stability",
   "nombre_canonico": "Crypto Winter Stability",
   "tipo": "fenomeno",
   "nombres_vistos": [
    "Crypto Winter Stability"
   ],
   "menciones": 1,
   "doc_frecuencia": 1,
   "doc_ids": [
    234
   ],
   "definiciones": [
    {
     "texto": "Hallazgo de que la predictibilidad de las medidas de microestructura sobre las dinámicas de precios apenas cambió durante el crypto winter (bear market profundo), mostrando estabilidad estructural de los efectos.",
     "doc_id": 234
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "Somewhat surprisingly, we find no effects of crypto winter on our results, suggesting a remarkable stability to the price dynamic effects uncovered here.",
     "doc_id": 234
    }
   ],
   "relaciones_crudas": [
    {
     "tipo": "MIDE",
     "tipo_original": "MIDE",
     "objeto_texto": "microstructure robustness",
     "doc_id": 234,
