     "texto": "Traders heterogeneos con coeficiente gamma que pesa rebate vs delay en su utilidad: max_i (gamma*tilde_r_i - ED_i).",
     "doc_id": 287
    }
   ],
   "citas": [
    {
     "texto": "investors are heterogeneous with respect to their way of trading off rebate against delay",
